tps://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/833444/000083344425000097/jci-20250930.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Johnson Controls International plc, headquartered in Cork, Ireland, is a global leader in smart, healthy and sustainable buildings, serving a wide range of customers around the globe. The Company's products, services, systems and solutions advance the safety, comfort and intelligence of spaces to serve people, places and the planet. The Company is committed to helping its customers win and creating greater value for all of its stakeholders through its strategic focus on buildings.","zh":"江森自控國際有限公司總部位於愛爾蘭科克，是智慧、健康和永續建築的全球領導者，為全球的廣大客戶提供服務。該公司的產品、服務、系統和解決方案提高了空間的安全性、舒適性和智慧性，為人類、地方和地球服務。公司致力於透過其對建築的策略重點來幫助客戶贏得勝利並為所有利益相關者創造更大的價值。"},{"en":"Johnson Controls was originally incorporated in the state of Wisconsin in 1885 as Johnson Electric Service Company to manufacture, install and service automatic temperature regulation systems for buildings and was renamed Johnson Controls,","zh":"江森自控最初於 1885 年在威斯康辛州成立，當時名為江森電氣服務公司，為建築物製造、安裝和維修自動溫度調節系統，後來更名為江森自控。"},{"en":"Inc. in 1974. In 2005, Johnson Controls acquired York International, a global supplier of heating, ventilating and air-conditioning (\"HVAC\") and refrigeration equipment and services. Following this acquisition, Johnson Controls continued to expand its portfolio of building-related product and service offerings. In 2016, Johnson Controls, Inc. and Tyco International plc (\"Tyco\") completed their combination (the \"Merger\"), combining Johnson Controls' portfolio of building efficiency solutions with Tyco's portfolio of fire and security solutions. Following the Merger, Tyco changed its name to \"Johnson Controls International plc.\"","zh":"公司於 1974 年成立。 2005 年，江森自控收購了全球暖氣、通風和空調 (“HVAC”) 及冷凍設備和服務供應商約克國際 (York International)。此次收購後，江森自控持續擴大建築相關產品及服務組合。 2016 年，江森自控公司和泰科國際公司（「泰科」）完成了合併（「合併」），將江森自控的建築能源效率解決方案組合與泰科的消防和安全解決方案組合相結合。合併後，泰科更名為「江森自控國際股份有限公司」。"}],"markets":[{"en":"In connection with the divestiture of the R&LC HVAC business, the Company realigned its organizational structure into three regional reporting segments (Americas, EMEA and APAC) from four reporting segments (Global Products, Building Solutions North America, Building Solutions EMEA/LA and Building Solutions APAC). The Company implemented this change effective April 1, 2025 as part of ongoing initiatives to drive simplification, accelerate growth, better reflect its organizational and operational structure and align with the manner in which the Company's chief operating decision maker assesses performance and makes decisions regarding the allocation of resources following portfolio simplification actions. As a result, the Company conducts its business through three operating segments, all of which are reportable segments:","zh":"隨著 R&LC HVAC 業務的剝離，公司將其組織結構從四個報告分部（全球產品、北美建築解決方案、歐洲、中東和非洲/洛杉磯建築解決方案和亞太地區建築解決方案）重新調整為三個區域報告分部（美洲、歐洲、中東和非洲和亞太地區）。該公司於 2025 年 4 月 1 日實施此變更，作為持續舉措的一部分，以推動簡化、加速成長、更好地反映其組織和營運結構，並與公司首席營運決策者在投資組合簡化行動後評估績效和做出有關資源分配的決策的方式保持一致。因此，公司透過三個經營分部開展業務，所有這些分部均為報告分部："},{"en":"Americas, which designs, manufactures, sells, installs and services HVAC, controls, building management, refrigeration, integrated electronic security systems, integrated fire detection and suppression systems, and digital (software) solutions for commercial, industrial, data center, institutional and governmental customers in the Americas (United States, Canada, and Latin America – Central and South America). Americas also provides energy efficiency solutions and technical services, including inspection, scheduled maintenance, and repair and replacement of mechanical and control systems, as well as data-driven \"smart building\" solutions, to the Americas marketplace.","zh":"美洲，為美洲（美國、加拿大和拉丁美洲 - 中美洲和南美洲）的商業、工業、資料中心、機構和政府客戶設計、製造、銷售、安裝和服務暖通空調、控制、建築管理、製冷、整合電子安全系統、整合火災偵測和滅火系統以及數位（軟體）解決方案。美洲也向美洲市場提供能源效率解決方案和技術服務，包括機械和控制系統的檢查、定期維護、維修和更換，以及數據驅動的「智慧建築」解決方案。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The Company conducts its operations through a significant number of individual contracts that are either negotiated or awarded on a competitive basis. Key factors in the award of contracts include system and service performance, quality, price, design, reputation, technology, application engineering capability, availability of financing and construction or project management expertise. Competitors for HVAC equipment, security, fire detection, fire suppression and controls in the residential and non-residential marketplace include many local, regional, national and international providers. Larger competitors include Honeywell International, Inc.; Siemens Smart Infrastructure, an operating group of Siemens AG; Schneider Electric SA; Carrier Global Corporation; Trane Technologies plc; Vertiv Holdings Co., API Group and Daikin Industries, Ltd. In addition, the Company competes in a highly fr","zh":"該公司透過大量的單獨合約開展業務，這些合約要么是談判的，要么是在競爭的基礎上授予的。授予合約的關鍵因素包括系統和服務性能、品質、價格、設計、聲譽、技術、應用工程能力、融資和建設或專案管理專業知識的可用性。住宅和非住宅市場的暖通空調設備、安全、火災偵測、滅火和控制領域的競爭對手包括許多本地、區域、國家和國際供應商。較大的競爭對手包括霍尼韋爾國際公司；西門子智慧基礎設施，西門子股份公司旗下營運集團；施耐德電氣公司；開利環球公司；特靈科技有限公司； Vertiv Holdings Co.、API Group 和 Daikin Industries, Ltd. 此外，該公司還在激烈的競爭中競爭"},{"en":"The Company's business strategy is to sustain and expand its position as a leader in commercial building technology and solutions by developing and implementing solutions designed to address its customers' vertical specific needs in their core missions. In 2024 and 2025, the Company acted to optimize its core commercial buildings portfolio with the divestitures of its Air Distribution Technologies and R&LC HVAC businesses. Following these portfolio optimization actions, the Company's core strategy remains advancing smart, healthy and sustainable buildings to power its customers' missions, enabled by a simpler, more focused company focused on driving growth, profit, and cash flow.","zh":"該公司的業務策略是透過開發和實施旨在滿足客戶核心任務中的垂直特定需求的解決方案，維持並擴大其作為商業建築技術和解決方案領導者的地位。 2024年和2025年，公司透過剝離空氣分配技術和R&LC HVAC業務來優化其核心商業建築組合。在這些投資組合優化行動之後，公司的核心策略仍然是推進智慧、健康和永續的建築，以推動客戶的使命，並透過一個更簡單、更專注的公司來實現，該公司專注於推動成長、利潤和現金流。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":15831000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":4968000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"APAC","val":2797000000,"zh":"亞太地區"}],"total":23596000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Productsand Systems","val":16124000000,"zh":"產品與系統"},{"name":"Service","val":7472000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":23596000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"US","val":13303000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":10293000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":23596000000}},"peers":["ITW","EMR","ETN","IR","CMI"]}}